{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An exciting, fun, weird new RPG filled with classic monster, you can fight.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight many different monsters from Mythology. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monsters like the Minotaur, the Trolls and the Medusa.. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Here are the Balrog fighting an Orc.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/extras/BalRog_OrcFight-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1748177545\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Magic in this game is wild...</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is an open-world, single player RPG game.<br>You can play it casually, taking your time to do quests and explore the world, or you can play it more hard-core. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choice between a fighter, Rogue or Wizard, each with their strength and weakness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>I like to play open-world RPGs like Skyrim, Oblivion, and Morrowind, as well as Tolkiens universe. So, I have taken the parts I like from them: the wild magic and alchemy from Morrowind, the bright colors from Oblivion, and Skyrim's weapon improvements.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Visit_WolfShire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/8ab1d9b80b192bcbc4c9969296bbe16671b255d2.jpg"},{"name":"VisitMossField","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/6cbb0ffd749d6aba9584fe6fe0865ca84eaba61d.jpg"},{"name":"Row Your Boat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/92639f450cb82409d0c5a64cf9b4ae1bf4c0cb9d.jpg"},{"name":"Just 5 more Minutes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/pu