rong>An exciting, fun, weird new RPG filled with classic monster, you can fight.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight many different monsters from Mythology. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monsters like the Minotaur, the Trolls and the Medusa.. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Here are the Balrog fighting an Orc.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/extras/BalRog_OrcFight-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1748177545\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Magic in this game is wild...</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is an open-world, single player RPG game.<br>You can play it casually, taking your time to do quests and explore the world, or you can play it more hard-core. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choice between a fighter, Rogue or Wizard, each with their strength and weakness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>I like to play open-world RPGs like Skyrim, Oblivion, and Morrowind, as well as Tolkiens universe. So, I have taken the parts I like from them: the wild magic and alchemy from Morrowind, the bright colors from Oblivion, and Skyrim's weapon improvements.</i></p>","developers":["J. C. SpringBourne"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/1cbe5bf712b0eb3a29cef89a9b60652ed73187ba/header.jpg?t=1748177545","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257144705,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144705/movie480.mp4?t=1748085772","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_tr